    "pages": [
     {
      "id": "rules.md",
      "title": "rules.md",
      "content": {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "# Liar's Cog Rules\n\nEach player holds a secret hand of dice. On your turn, bid a claim about how many times a face appears across ALL hands combined (e.g. 'three 6s'), or challenge the previous bid. Each bid must strictly raise the last: higher quantity wins, ties broken by higher face. A challenge reveals all hands; if the bid was true the bidder wins, otherwise the challenger wins. The skill is reading opponents' bids as signals about their hidden hands."
      }
     }
    ],
    "readme": {
     "type": "uri",
     "value": "https://github.com/Metta-AI/coworld-liars-cog/blob/main/README.md"
    }
   },
